This article does not apply to:

(1) Gifts, grants, or unsolicited donations where no sponsorship agreement exists or is required;

(2) Parades or events sponsored or co-sponsored by the city pursuant to other ordinances or rules;

(3) Facilities in Kapiolani Regional Park; and

