(Sec. 5-15.4, R.O. 1978 (1983 Ed.)) (1990 Code, Ch. 6, Art. 11, § 6-11.4) (Am. Ord. 18-3)

The following policy shall govern the availability of public data.

(a) Public data may be obtained by governmental agencies and the general public from the department of information technology in the medium (such as compact disk) as determined by the department of information technology.

