(1990 Code, Ch. 18, Art. 7, § 18-7.2) (Added by Ord. 89-135; Am. Ords. 93-59, 15-18, 24-3, 24-17)

This chapter shall not apply to the following:

(1) Mining or quarrying operations regulated by other city ordinances;

(2) Excavation and backfill for the construction of basements and footings of a building, retaining wall, or other structure authorized by a valid building permit. This shall not exempt any fill made outside the building lines or the placing of fill material obtained from the excavations on other premises;

