(Sec. 13-42.3, R.O. 1978 (1987 Supp. to 1983 Ed.)) (1990 Code, Ch. 41, Art. 21, § 41-21.3) (Am. Ords. 97-20, 02-06, 13-27, 13-28, 25-2)

